{"id":909960,"title":"05｜使用扣子空间远程运维本地服务器","content":"远程运维指将 Agent 部署于云端（如 Coze 空间），通过配置本地 MCP Server 调用工具以管理本地服务器，从而利用云端强大的深度思考能力降低开发成本。为确保通信安全，Coze 强制要求接入端点必须采用 HTTPS 协议并绑定备案域名。\n\n在访问控制方面，除官方 OAuth 机制外，可通过在 MCP Server 前添加中间件实现简易的 Basic Auth 认证。服务端代码需拦截请求头中的 Authorization 字段验证 Bearer Token，非法请求返回 401；客户端则在连接时携带对应 Header。\n\n接入 Coze 需完成三步基础建设：首先购买包年包月云服务器并申请域名，完成实名及 ICP 备案；其次使用 Certbot 工具生成自签名 SSL 证书，获取 fullchain.pem 与 privkey.pem 文件；最后修改 MCP Server 启动代码，加载 SSL 证书以启用 HTTPS 服务。注意 Coze 目前仅支持 SSE 传输协议。\n\n配置完成后，在 Coze 平台添加自定义工具，填入 HTTPS 域名地址及认证 Header。经测试，Agent 可成功识别指令、构造参数并调用本地工具执行操作，实现了安全的远程服务器运维闭环。该方案虽涉及服务器与域名成本，但为构建企业级 AI 应用提供了标准化的安全接入路径。","comments":[{"had_liked":false,"id":403213,"user_name":"Lydia","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1163311,"ip_address":"广东","ucode":"4DEC526CD77ACA","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/11/c0/2f/093715e5.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1762317595,"is_pvip":false,"replies":[{"id":146494,"content":"目前不行 只能传github","user_name":"作者回复","user_name_real":"编辑","uid":1943646,"ctime":1762402882,"ip_address":"山东","comment_id":403213,"utype":1}],"discussion_count":1,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":101074901,"comment_content":"老师，可以把代码放在末尾吗","like_count":0,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":1943646,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/1d/a8/5e/791d0f5e.jpg","nickname":"最后的风之子","note":"","ucode":"45D5487480A5D2","race_medal":0,"user_type":2,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":673707,"discussion_content":"目前不行 只能传github","content_length":28,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1762402882,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":true,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"山东","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"{\"reply\":true,\"user_type\":2,\"source\":0}","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]}]}